      "text": "29 Seconds of Farcaster ... What did you miss this weekend?\n\n* Snapathon, Snapfest, Snapchella ... it's all about the SNAPS. IRL Meetups to build SNAPS in LA, NYC, & SF and the SNAP vibes are high on the timeline. The most notable SNAP build is probably @mattlee 's SNAP builder @freeturtle | https://farcaster.xyz/mattlee/0xb5e9b30d\n\n* Scheduling Note: @rish will be on /gmfarcaster today around 12 NOON EST to talk SNAPS, and all things Farcaster\n\n* How about some fun, under-the-radar builds from the weekend? @anaroth bult the Farcaster Movie Index that folks seemed to enjoy https://farcaster.xyz/anaroth/0xe0a13674 | and @bfg shared Casts Vault which allows you search, tag, & organize bookmarked casts https://farcaster.xyz/bfg/0x0a649bf0 | Also @arjantupan created a Daily Spark mini app for a creative prompt a day https://farcaster.xyz/arjantupan/0x6cb4d10f ... it's fun to see less heralded builders create mini apps for themselves that others can use and enjoy s/o @neynar studio for making it possible\n\n* BETR with @burr.eth wrapped up a 100M $BETR tournament and I haven't seen the final results but I think @spaceman-ngu.eth is going to be happy after a narrow miss in March Madness .. Thanks for making The Masters BETR\n\n* Join @adrienne & @nounishprof at 11:30 AM EST for lots more news and fun and don't miss @rish joining them around Noon for all the FC updates 💜",
